{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_6000_situation", "source_sha256": "80857bb20ceebad3283073a9ee5812e3a539bcfd5cddd754fde4cfa44cac5de8", "ja": "写真撮影　休憩中", "zh": "拍照　休息中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_6000_place", "source_sha256": "668636b4e2dcc893250a5be73c65f37634c531af4d97783a5103d101a5962674", "ja": "ハウススタジオ", "zh": "室内摄影棚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_6001_p", "source_sha256": "2b51ef0425bdce00a9edd6fdc5a2cc4fef4e75734fc41deb932f5fbb96fa5107", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の企画で、律子と\n動画サイトで話題のタレント猫とのコラボ撮影だ）", "zh": "（在写真杂志《アイグラ！！》的企划中，律子要和在视频网站上引起话题的明星猫咪合作拍摄）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_6002_009rit", "source_sha256": "4a2b6fafb6bd02794dd8facc4d4e9e6924b23170a9dc7977aaa276aa66a8e0a9", "ja": "はぁ～、本当にかわいいですね。初めて会った私にも\nゴロゴロ喉を鳴らして懐いてくれるなんて……。", "zh": "哈啊～，真的好可爱啊。第一次见面的我，它居然也会呼噜呼噜地亲近，真是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_6003_p", "source_sha256": "82ee011337b1ef98554d335c2adc2d07af49586720732456b41b65b49568f560", "ja": "分かるよ……。足元であんなに可愛く鳴かれたら\n骨抜きになっちゃうよな。", "zh": "我懂……被它在脚边那么可爱地叫着，谁都会被迷得神魂颠倒吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_6004_009rit", "source_sha256": "bed777b604dbf5ede4daba602179862aba40cc1923d6b46e6d1b8d72949914a7", "ja": "{$P$}もですか！？\nさすが今をときめくタレント猫……。", "zh": "连{$P$}也是吗！？\n真不愧是红极一时的明星猫……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_6005_009rit", "source_sha256": "872f237d1288363203e957b30c9fc7266bc3be704ca7c47a08e1e4c58216d080", "ja": "でも、そうなっても当然っていうか、人気の理由は\n分かるんですよね。あの子、すっごく自然体で。", "zh": "不过，就算变成那样也很正常吧。或者说，我能理解它为什么这么受欢迎。那孩子特别自然。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_6006_009rit", "source_sha256": "51d7da17e09d936ae263e7533d37937f1281d58dfe5af388f9ddf01031013012", "ja": "ありのままの姿を私たちに見せてくれてるんだーって\nすごく嬉しくなっちゃうんですよね。", "zh": "一想到她把真实的样子展现给我们看——就会觉得特别开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_6007_p", "source_sha256": "9e5df2916cadc54ae52a213506979b2467655ae10773d14dd1af8c540e423301", "ja": "どの環境でもそれが発揮できるように、飼い主さんが\nあの猫の個性をちゃんと把握しているんだろうな。", "zh": "为了让它在任何环境下都能展现出这一点，猫主人肯定很了解那只猫的个性吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_6008_009rit", "source_sha256": "9e40cf55ad907c94fbd0fa198abd8cfe8094a44aa92bd7e46b32f611b0779691", "ja": "なるほど、じゃあ飼い主はあの猫のプロデューサー\nでもあるわけですね。……あ、そうだ。", "zh": "原来如此，也就是说，猫主人同时也是那只猫的制作人呢……啊，对了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_6009_009rit", "source_sha256": "33ed23d82dd29fda48b2836f1922d55e950f07c41d3a039750b89b38fa95477e", "ja": "この衣装を着た私を、タレント猫だと見立てて……、\n{$P$}殿なら、どう売り出しますか？", "zh": "把穿着这身服装的我当成一只明星猫……{$P$}先生，您会怎么推广呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_6010", "source_sha256": "131327942f7fe4a85a5dcab9619018ba017b4ebb8cf2da56ec48615bebe7fec8", "ja": "頑張り屋猫", "zh": "努力猫", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_6011", "source_sha256": "7e345d66a1f43bcf26a067040364fb4fcc426b2eb436c510aa9d69a092fcc8db", "ja": "天才猫", "zh": "天才猫", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_6012", "source_sha256": "fc12c2e44c3240cd18f0dcab35ea949262e2b6e983c854bba2bfb031e785ba4a", "ja": "メガネコ", "zh": "眼镜猫", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_6100_p", "source_sha256": "2b7ff4283e8778ede433762592ec37ace42ac0f856807b8a7b2fcb8743f8cf10", "ja": "律子は勤勉で努力家だからな。頑張り屋猫が困難を\n乗り越える、珠玉のドキュメンタリー、なんてどうだ？", "zh": "律子勤勉又努力嘛。讲一只努力猫克服困难的\n绝妙纪录片，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_6101_009rit", "source_sha256": "b1d8bbe24a20be86a6e7e6e966b506fb46d38e9f262179ad69ae5fbbb6fef731", "ja": "ふむ。それには、相当な困難を克服するんじゃないと\n説得力が出ないですよね。……うん、面白そう！", "zh": "嗯。要拍那个，就得克服相当大的困难，才会有说服力吧。……嗯，听起来很有意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_6102_009rit", "source_sha256": "9eb3a83b1dfc19103b06a63c1a24f6da85ac7ce47daf3e50ae1d8642ce47a7e5", "ja": "手始めに何がいいかな～……あ、あとでまとめて\n相談しに行きますね！　ふふふ、待っててにゃん♪", "zh": "先从什么开始比较好呢～……啊，我待会儿再一起去找你商量！呵呵呵，等着我喵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_6200_p", "source_sha256": "073d9a91943959299cb35884fed254ed8cec0ec5cbc48fb96519a41dfe41e5b0", "ja": "律子が猫になっても頭脳明晰だと思う、\nだから天才猫として売り出そう！", "zh": "就算律子变成猫也肯定聪明过人，\n所以就作为天才猫来推广吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_6201_009rit", "source_sha256": "1b1238aaf705f3db5cbc2253c5ab6973ec60359da4e9b027bf441d9ab944bb80", "ja": "て、天才って……。私は別に天才じゃないですけど……\nとにかく、まだ甘いですよ、{$P$}？", "zh": "天、天才什么的……我又不是什么天才……总之，您还是太天真了，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_6202_009rit", "source_sha256": "5bd0aab815dd4a7a3e624acdf572d37b3b0fbf89853001e3808f71be6c81a59c", "ja": "どう天才なのか、を見せていく方法が大事ですからね。\nこれから一緒に考えましょう！", "zh": "所以，重要的是要想办法展现出自己究竟天才在哪里。  \n接下来我们一起想想吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_6300_p", "source_sha256": "69decb9b353dd710ab571384e12c143fe9bc03a3bd2e49b5e62e8f786e041778", "ja": "眼鏡をかけた猫……メガネコとして売り出そう。\n普通の猫とは違うチャームポイントが目を引くはずだ！", "zh": "戴眼镜的猫……就作为“眼镜猫”推出吧。和普通猫不一样的魅力点，肯定会吸引大家的目光！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_6301_009rit", "source_sha256": "b943169cb9c2869d76c10e5fa365ea87f27a9e4b299fdffcadd25310cefbf35c", "ja": "め、メガ……。語呂は悪くないかも？　確かに、眼鏡は\nアピールポイントのひとつにはなりそうですけど……。", "zh": "眼、眼镜……叫起来好像也不难听？确实，眼镜或许能成为吸引目光的一大卖点，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_6302_009rit", "source_sha256": "183761b81f8f5eb1d42186ab8afcd44a9c285d05ca5b7bac82957e0aa3fb891f", "ja": "でも！　今の世の中、眼鏡をかけてるだけで売れるほど\nアイドルも猫も甘くないんじゃないですか？　もう。", "zh": "但是！如今这个时代，偶像和猫咪可没那么好糊弄，不是光戴副眼镜就能走红的吧？真是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
